      "finding": "Monorepo package scoping: The GitHub repository at tag v0.18.1 contains excalidraw-app/, packages/excalidraw/, packages/math/, packages/utils/, firebase-project/, and dev-docs/. The official npm tarball @excalidraw/excalidraw@0.18.1 ships ONLY compiled dist/{dev,prod,types} artifacts produced by scripts/buildPackage.js (esbuild 0.19.10), bundling @excalidraw/math and @excalidraw/utils internally while declaring third-party dependencies (roughjs, jotai, open-color, fractional-indexing, perfect-freehand) as external npm dependencies."
